flowchart TD
    Start([START: Update Account Status\nflow: autolaunched\nvariable: accountType String input\nvariable: accountId String input])
    Decision{DECISION: Check Account Type}
    Update1[UPDATE: Update Enterprise Account\nobject: Account\nfilter: Id = ref:accountId\nfield: Name = "Enterprise Account"]
    Update2[UPDATE: Update Standard Account\nobject: Account\nfilter: Id = ref:accountId\nfield: Name = "Standard Account"]
    End([END: Updated])

    Start --> Decision
    Decision -->|Enterprise if accountType = "Enterprise"| Update1
    Decision -->|Standard default| Update2
    Update1 --> End
    Update2 --> End
